    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This function returns the number of negative, zero, and positive pivots that the sparse factorization functions, [`SparseFactor(_:_:)`](sparsefactor(_:_:)-8gl6j.md) and [`SparseFactor(_:_:_:_:)`](sparsefactor(_:_:_:_:)-88xmk.md), take during an *LDLᵀ* factorization.",
      "ko": "This function returns the number of negative, zero, and positive pivots that the sparse factorization functions, [`SparseFactor(_:_:)`](sparsefactor(_:_:)-8gl6j.md) and [`SparseFactor(_:_:_:_:)`](sparsefactor(_:_:_:_:)-88xmk.md), take during an *LDLᵀ* factorization.",
      "sourceHash": "c8d063558994feaf91d9f8300e62751cf9d4ad9028846e040effd1d242935f7b",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "In some cases — for example, when the original matrix’s eigenvalues are close to zero — the computed numerical inertia may not be an accurate reflection of the true inertia.",
      "ko": "In some cases — for example, when the original matrix’s eigenvalues are close to zero — the computed numerical inertia may not be an accurate reflection of the true inertia.",
      "sourceHash": "eb5879a307cf2bfd3b63f79c0151b703717d79896fb30404198d802ef2ee5a21",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "In such cases, the computed numerical inertia is dependent on the [`zeroTolerance`](sparsenumericfactoroptions/zerotolerance.md) and [`pivotTolerance`](sparsenumericfactoroptions/pivottolerance.md) values of the [`SparseNumericFactorOptions`](sparsenumericfactoroptions.md) structure.",
      "ko": "In such cases, the computed numerical inertia is dependent on the [`zeroTolerance`](sparsenumericfactoroptions/zerotolerance.md) and [`pivotTolerance`](sparsenumericfactoroptions/pivottolerance.md) values of the [`SparseNumericFactorOptions`](sparsenumericfactoroptions.md) structure.",
      "sourceHash": "6a46eb42ce028442d465b29cbe04179a5a94c88b6131fd1b9583ad044a32f847",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: This function supports only [`SparseFactorizationLDLTTPP`](sparsefactorizationldlttpp.md) factorizations.",
      "ko": "❗ **Important**: This function supports only [`SparseFactorizationLDLTTPP`](sparsefactorizationldlttpp.md) factorizations.",
      "sourceHash": "d54e64b8ee3c14ad65574f8caffb4c4701458a78869dc13c1d226a9a490d88ef",
      "status": "failed"
